<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">24062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Israel's forces have crept uphill through south Lebanon, moving between three broken ceasefires this month toward higher ground that commands the Nabatieh valley.</s> <s>As talks open in Washington, the word on the table is "repositioning" — a euphemism for holding the territory Israel now occupies rather than withdrawing from it.</s> <s>More than four thousand Lebanese have been killed since the fighting began, and this fifth round of talks tests whether even a partial pullback is possible.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iran's nuclear program collided with American constitutional politics this week, as the United States Senate voted fifty to forty-eight to order President Trump to cease hostilities against Tehran.</s> <s>It was the tenth attempt, and the first time both chambers backed such a measure — but as a concurrent resolution it never reaches the president's desk, leaving its force untested in court.</s> <s>Four Republicans crossed the aisle... and the question now is whether Congress can enforce a war power it hasn't exercised in generations.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Vladimir Putin says Moscow is ready to talk peace with Ukraine, but only on the basis of the twenty twenty-two Istanbul agreements.</s> <s>Those terms required Ukraine to renounce NATO, cap its armed forces, and cede Crimea — an offer framed as compromise that in fact codifies Russia's maximum war aims.</s> <s>Since that draft, Russia has annexed four more regions it never mentioned, so Kyiv hears not an olive branch but a demand for surrender.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United States Treasury sanctioned a Lagos currency dealer named Mukhtar Muhammad and three firms it says financed the Islamic State's West Africa Province.</s> <s>Informal money changers are how the group moves cash across northern Nigeria and the Lake Chad basin, far from any formal bank.</s> <s>Whether cutting one dealer off from the dollar disrupts a network built on cash and trust is the open question.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A peace board convened by President Trump has demanded that Palestinian forces in Gaza disarm, leaving only a police force behind.</s> <s>Its May report called disarmament "the single factor that unlocks every other element" of a settlement, placing the burden on the occupied rather than the occupier.</s> <s>More than one thousand Palestinians have been killed since October's ceasefire, documents show, which makes the demand to lay down arms a fraught one.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Under Xi Jinping, the Communist Party has extended its control over political language so far that it now shapes how the world's news is written.</s> <s>Wire services and translation desks quietly self-edit terms about Xinjiang and Taiwan to keep their access to Beijing, with no order given and no obligation to disclose what they leave out.</s> <s>It's censorship exported not through firewalls but through vocabulary, and it spreads precisely because the silence is invisible.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>France recorded its hottest day ever this week, forty-four degrees Celsius in the southwest, as a heat wave turned deadly across western Europe.</s> <s>Forty people have drowned since the eighteenth of June seeking relief, and two small children died locked inside a parked car.</s> <s>Each summer's record is becoming the next baseline, and the dead cluster among those states protect least — the very young, the old, the outdoor worker.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Andy Burnham would walk into Downing Street already boxed in by the bond market, investors warn, if he signals heavier borrowing for a bolder agenda.</s> <s>The lesson for any incoming Labour government is blunt: gilt markets price a chancellor's politics before a single policy is passed, and "too left-wing" becomes a judgment about yields, not values.</s> <s>Starmer's resignation has frozen Britain's reset with Europe, and the bond market, not the manifesto, may set the limits.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United States Supreme Court stripped Cuba of its sovereign immunity in a six-to-three ruling, exposing decades-old nationalizations to American courts for the first time.</s> <s>Justices held that the Helms-Burton Act removes the shield protecting Cuban state firms, opening sixty-five-year-old expropriations to litigation.</s> <s>Nearly six thousand claimants holding one point nine billion dollars in frozen Cuban assets now have a path to sue, and Havana calls it an assault on its sovereignty.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Thailand bet its industrial future on electric vehicles, subsidizing assembly plants, but it never built the local component makers underneath them.</s> <s>The country became a host for foreign supply chains rather than a manufacturer within them, hollowing out its claim to be the Detroit of Southeast Asia.</s> <s>Without homegrown parts suppliers, Thailand's standing now depends on decisions made in Beijing and Tokyo, not Bangkok.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nouriel Roubini, the economist nicknamed Doctor Doom for predicting the two thousand eight crash and one of crypto's loudest critics, is now tokenizing the dollar.</s> <s>He's co-authored a blockchain token backed by his Nasdaq-listed fund of Treasuries and money-market holdings, aiming to launch this quarter under the United Arab Emirates' new virtual-asset rules.</s> <s>That the skeptic has joined the experiment tells you how far tokenized money has moved from the fringe.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Off the two coasts of the Mediterranean, sperm whales are speaking in different dialects.</s> <s>Researchers found that eastern and western groups use distinct patterns of clicks, and that the dialect is passed down socially rather than genetically, with the eastern whales evolving a faster version after the populations split twenty thousand years ago.</s> <s>It reframes what we mean by culture and language, showing both can be inherited through learning in a mind that isn't human.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A neurotransmitter best known for calming the brain turns out to help one of its deadliest tumors hide.</s> <s>Researchers found that <sub alias="gabba">GABA</sub> strengthens the immune-suppressing cells around glioblastoma, but only in females — a sex-specific effect that current immunotherapies ignore entirely.</s> <s>If it holds in patients, brain-cancer treatment may need to be dosed differently for women and men, a quiet rebuke to one-size-fits-all oncology.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Cambridge, scientists have injected working liver tissue into mice without any surgery at all.</s> <s>Liver cells packed into tiny hydrogel spheres attached themselves to the animals' blood vessels and kept functioning for two months, a possible bridge for patients waiting for a donor organ.</s> <s>The team is now testing whether those same spheres can deliver drugs to stop the body rejecting them.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan has handed its main anti-corruption agency an artificial-intelligence system to screen complaints, analyze finances, and refer cases.</s> <s>The National Accountability Bureau built it with a state AI center, but it hasn't disclosed how the system reaches its decisions, or who reviews them.</s> <s>When an opaque algorithm helps decide who gets investigated for corruption, the tool meant to ensure accountability may end up escaping it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The wave of "age verification" laws sweeping legislatures is, mechanically, mass surveillance, critics argue.</s> <s>To prove you're an adult, you must prove who you are, to every website, permanently — turning verification vendors into vast vaults of identity that become single points of failure.</s> <s>One breach at one vendor could expose everyone at once, and some governments are already moving to ban the private networks people use to slip the net.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>